Package: notepad-plus-plus
Version: @VERSION@
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: wine | wine64 | wine-stable | wine-development
Recommends: winbind, fonts-liberation
Suggests: winetricks
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Homepage: https://notepad-plus-plus.org/
Description: Notepad++ source code editor (Windows build, runs via Wine)
 Notepad++ is a free (GPL) source code editor and Notepad replacement that
 supports dozens of programming and natural languages, built on the Scintilla
 editing component.
 .
 This package contains the genuine Windows build of Notepad++, compiled from
 source with MinGW-w64, together with a launcher and desktop integration that
 run it under Wine. Every Notepad++ feature - plugins, user-defined languages,
 sessions, macros, themes - works exactly as on Windows because it IS the
 Windows program.
 .
 This is NOT a native Linux port; it requires Wine at runtime.
